              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lokho umuntu akwehlukanisele iNkosi, kakuyikuthengiswa, futhi kakuyikuhlengwa; ngitsho konke alakho, loba kungumuntu, loba inyamazana, loba insimu eyilifa lakhe; konke okwehlukaniselwe iNkosi kungcwele kakhulu eNkosini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
